    <string name="guide_step1_title">Your Offline Focus Shield</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_body">Tap this Focus Shield orb (or the switch below) to arm protection. Warden scans visible text completely offline and sends you Home whenever a blocked keyword appears.</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_cta">Enable Accessibility Permission</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_title">At-a-Glance Filter Stats</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_body">See your blocked words, safe phrases, and grace window at a glance. Tap any tile to jump straight into editing that rule.</string>
    <string name="guide_step3_title">The Adversarial AI Gatekeeper</string>
    <string name="guide_step3_body">Need temporary access to an app? Tap Request Temporary Pass to chat with Gemini and justify your need with 7 complete sentences. Gemini’s default verdict is NO.</string>
    <string name="guide_step4_title">Blocked Words &amp; Safe Phrases</string>
    <string name="guide_step4_body">Switch between Blocked words and Safe Phrases here. Example: block “shorts”, then add “basketball shorts” as a Safe Phrase so legitimate text never triggers a block.</string>
    <string name="guide_step5_title">Grace Window</string>
    <string name="guide_step5_body">Controls how many seconds Warden waits and re-checks the screen before sending you Home—preventing accidental triggers when scrolling past a word.</string>
    <string name="guide_step6_title">Gemini AI &amp; Vault Locks</string>
    <string name="guide_step6_body">Paste and validate your Google AI Studio API key here, pick your Gemini model, set a Settings Password, and activate Anti-Uninstall protection. Replay this tour anytime via the ? button.</string>

